            </conditions>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>Sales_Development_Record_Type</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <label>Records found</label>
        </rules>
    </decisions>
    <description>- When a Closed Won, Americas-region, Sales Development Opportunity that hasn’t yet had a renewal created contains renewable products, the flow automatically:
  - Creates a new Renewal Opportunity due in about a year
  - Copies over all contact roles
  - Re-creates products appropriately:
    - INITIAL products are swapped to their defined Renewal Service Product on the renewal
    - RENEWAL products remain the same product
  - Flags the original Opportunity as processed and moves the renewal opportunity to the “Solution” stage
Finally, launches the Renewal Opportunity Task Creation flow to create the corresponding associated reminder tasks with due dates derived from the the expected close date of the renewal opportunity.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <description>Set date to one year from now</description>
        <name>SetExpectedClosedDate</name>
        <dataType>Date</dataType>
        <expression>{!$Record.CloseDate} + 365</expression>
    </formulas>
    <interviewLabel>Create Renewal Opportunity {!$Flow.CurrentDateTime}</interviewLabel>
    <label>Create Renewal Opportunity</label>
    <loops>
